Package: climatechange
Title: Flood and Conflict Exposure Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Derrick", "DEMEVENG", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   email = "demeveng@example.com")
Description: Utility functions for computing population exposure to river
    flooding using Copernicus GLOFAS flood hazard rasters, WorldPop
    age/sex-disaggregated population rasters, and GeoBoundaries or GADM
    administrative boundaries.
